  "session": "autoinit_phase_a_failed",
  "note": "reduced spec for a Phase-A run that did not reach ALL_DONE. Only the evidence file is required: a gate that blocks teardown on artifacts the run correctly refused to produce keeps a failed pod billing, and this session is the most expensive in the project to leave running. Everything else is collected if present \u2014 above all the probe journal, because a run that died at hour eleven with six completed probes must come home with those six, and the gate logs, which are what a failure needs read afterwards.",
